{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212360","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121236001:0":{"text":"あの子が逃げちまったよ！まったく！ボロボロの状態でよくもまあ、あんな素早く動けるもんだ！","source_cn":"那姑娘跑了！气死我了……伤成那样，跑得比谁都快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF288030A2ED6AA5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121236002:0":{"text":"逃げた？そんな……まだ私たちを信用していないのでしょうか……？","source_cn":"跑了？怎么会……她还是不愿意相信我们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C02522C11B72250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121236003:1":{"text":"そう簡単には、あの子の信頼は得られないだろうね。","source_cn":"莱卡，想赢得她的信任，没那么容易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCA7A2AC3EC5C6BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121236004:0":{"text":"ずっとブラックゴールドに飼われてたんだ、信じてもらうには時間が必要だよ。","source_cn":"她被黑金商会养了那么久，我们需要多给她一点耐心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51EDD21720E575A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121236005:0":{"text":"ダウナエおばあ様！あの子が異幻の迷宮に向かうのを見た人がいるそうです！","source_cn":"达赫妮婆婆！有人看见她往诡幻迷宫的方向去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB4D30FA5C68FD2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit